# Live data and local run outputs
data/
# ...but src/data/ and src/dashboard/data/ are SOURCE directories, not data
# outputs. The bare `data/` pattern above matched them too, so critical modules
# (src/data/loaders.py, price_sanitizer.py, artifact_contracts.py, and the
# dashboard data managers) were silently untracked. Re-include the source.
!src/data/
!src/dashboard/data/
reports/daily_operations_report_*.json
reports/
notebooks/
ns_uso/
universe/

# Local generated dataset / kaggle artifacts (entirely untracked; their
